        <type>size_t</type>
        <definition>size_t sharding::OrphanDetector::cleanPercolatorLocks</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::shared_ptr&lt; themisdb::sharding::CrossShardTransactionCoordinator &gt; &amp;coordinator)</argsstring>
        <name>cleanPercolatorLocks</name>
        <qualifiedname>sharding::OrphanDetector::cleanPercolatorLocks</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::shared_ptr&lt; <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1sharding_1_1_cross_shard_transaction_coordinator" kindref="compound">themisdb::sharding::CrossShardTransactionCoordinator</ref> &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>coordinator</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Clean Percolator Locks. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reclaim stale Percolator locks left by failed coordinators.</para>
<para>Scans all active transactions in <computeroutput>coordinator</computeroutput>, identifies those using the PERCOLATOR protocol whose locks have been held longer than <ref refid="structsharding_1_1_orphan_detector_1_1_config_1a297ada32505a03c0c2405d48ce742aaf" kindref="member">Config::timeout_seconds</ref>, and aborts them via the coordinator&apos;s abort() method. The abort triggers lock release on every shard participant.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>coordinator</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The cross-shard coordinator to scan and clean. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Number of stale Percolator locks reclaimed.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">coordinator</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value.</para>
</simplesect>
Calls: spdlog::warn(), getActiveTransactions(), std::chrono::system_clock::now(), std::chrono::seconds(), spdlog::info(), count(), abort(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
